contentText:
Lightning might not strike twice, but Zach Bryan will.

The country star had to delay and shorten his Saturday (April 25) show in Nebraska due to inclement weather. Prior to the start of the performance, Bryan took to X to let his fans know that the show would start later than originally intended, writing, &#8220;tour in the spring they said, it’ll be fun they said.&#8221;

